Determine if you should wake up:

If the hourOfDay is valid, we need to decide if you should wake up. We can use the barking parameter to check if the dog is currently barking.

You should wake up if the dog is barking (barking is true) and the hourOfDay is less than 8 (before 8 AM) or greater than 22 (after 10 PM).

Return the result:

Use the return statement to return true if you should wake up based on the conditions above. Otherwise, return false.